# CLI deploys (`vercel deploy --prod`) upload this folder directly instead
# of building from GitHub (the Hobby plan blocks git deploys from commit
# authors other than the project owner). Never upload secrets or local
# build output — Vercel builds remotely with the project's own env vars.
.env*
!.env.local.example
node_modules
.next
.git
.vercel
.claude
supabase/.temp
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
*.pem
